    "finalPromptText": "Thanks for that. I'm trying to decide whether to switch from the 6th to the 7th edition for my course. Could you give me a high-level summary of the topics and organization of Molecular Biology of the Cell (7th ed., 2022, Alberts et al.)? I'm especially interested in how the chapters are grouped — the major parts or sections of the book.",
